WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:04.680
I'm Himeno Awayuki, age sixteen.

00:04.680 --> 00:09.390
Due to my father's remarriage, all of the sudden, I became the daughter of an executive.

00:09.390 --> 00:14.590
But I can't seem to get used to this life, and on top of that, I'm in a state of solitude, always being picked on!

00:14.590 --> 00:17.700
Above that, these mysterious guys called the Leafe Knights showed up,

00:17.700 --> 00:21.300
...telling me stuff like, "Please save the world," and making even more trouble for me!

00:21.300 --> 00:23.890
I really don't know what's going on.

00:31.180 --> 00:32.640
This is...

00:33.880 --> 00:37.150
The boundless future stretches across the skies

00:33.880 --> 00:37.150
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

00:37.150 --> 00:41.190
And I am reborn anew

00:37.150 --> 00:41.190
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

00:41.190 --> 00:48.210
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

00:41.190 --> 00:48.210
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

00:52.170 --> 00:52.370
Prétear

01:00.440 --> 01:07.350
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

01:00.440 --> 01:07.350
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:07.350 --> 01:12.140
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:07.350 --> 01:12.140
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:14.190 --> 01:21.090
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:14.190 --> 01:21.090
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

01:21.090 --> 01:26.000
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

01:21.090 --> 01:26.000
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

01:27.830 --> 01:31.700
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

01:27.830 --> 01:31.700
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

01:31.700 --> 01:34.840
If the cold wind glimmers

01:31.700 --> 01:34.840
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

01:34.840 --> 01:40.610
I can hear your voice drifting gently

01:34.840 --> 01:40.610
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

01:40.780 --> 01:41.080
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

01:40.780 --> 01:45.550
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

01:45.550 --> 01:48.090
Warms it so much that it hurts

01:45.550 --> 01:48.090
kono mune o atsuku suru

01:48.090 --> 01:50.820
It all begins from the point of believing

01:48.090 --> 01:50.820
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

01:50.820 --> 01:54.490
These feelings are proof of being alive

01:50.820 --> 01:54.490
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

01:54.490 --> 01:54.790
The endless future and the expanding skies

01:54.490 --> 01:57.700
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:57.700 --> 02:01.730
Allow me to be reborn anew

01:57.700 --> 02:01.730
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:01.730 --> 02:07.840
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:01.730 --> 02:07.840
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:07.840 --> 02:12.440
Holding hands with you

02:07.840 --> 02:14.440
sono te tsunaide

02:14.610 --> 02:17.980
Let Me Hear Your Heart Flutter

02:18.050 --> 02:20.420
This is Prétear?

02:21.290 --> 02:21.990
All right!

02:21.990 --> 02:23.650
Shin! The containment field!

02:24.790 --> 02:25.760
<i>Beyondios!</i>

02:42.570 --> 02:43.740
What's this?

02:43.740 --> 02:47.050
It's a field created between the human world and Leafenia.

02:47.050 --> 02:50.110
Here, the effects of the battle won't touch the human world.

02:50.480 --> 02:53.690
Was that you, Hayate? Where are you speaking from?

02:53.690 --> 02:55.650
I'm inside you right now.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.720
Inside?!

02:57.720 --> 02:58.590
Inside is inside.

02:59.760 --> 03:00.020
Inside

03:00.630 --> 03:02.460
Inside body

03:00.890 --> 03:02.130
Insi...

03:00.990 --> 03:02.460
Inside

03:00.990 --> 03:02.460
Body

03:02.690 --> 03:04.330
Inside?! What the hell is that?!

03:04.330 --> 03:05.860
That's disgusting!

03:05.860 --> 03:10.070
We Knights can fuse our souls with the Prétear by préting.

03:10.070 --> 03:11.370
It's not in body!

03:11.370 --> 03:13.370
I don't know about préting or whatever,

03:13.370 --> 03:16.200
...but there's no difference between that and us becoming one...

03:16.840 --> 03:17.980
One?!

03:17.980 --> 03:19.840
This is no time to be embarrassed!

03:19.840 --> 03:21.210
The demon larva is coming!

03:22.380 --> 03:23.750
We'll assist you!

03:24.180 --> 03:26.720
Himeno, hurry up and finish off the demon larva!

03:26.720 --> 03:29.790
You say to hurry, but what am I supposed to do?!

03:29.790 --> 03:30.690
Use the wind!

03:31.190 --> 03:32.820
I'm the Leafe Knight of the Wind.

03:32.820 --> 03:34.990
You can command the wind at will!

03:36.030 --> 03:36.730
Wind?

03:36.730 --> 03:38.330
Wind... Wind... Wind...

03:38.330 --> 03:39.300
WIND!

03:42.830 --> 03:43.990
Himeno?

03:47.340 --> 03:48.100
Look out!

03:49.840 --> 03:50.580
Hayate!

03:50.580 --> 03:52.480
It's nothing! Don't drop your guard!

03:52.480 --> 03:54.000
Now, unleash the wind!

03:54.680 --> 03:56.940
Don't yell at me! I still don't know how to do this!

04:01.120 --> 04:01.640
All right!

04:04.590 --> 04:05.280
You're kidding me?!

04:08.530 --> 04:09.150
It didn't work?!

04:09.890 --> 04:11.500
Like we're gonna let you!

04:11.500 --> 04:12.860
Himeno! Finish it off!

04:13.400 --> 04:14.730
Concentrate!

04:14.730 --> 04:18.330
You must feel it! The new wind Leafe residing in you as Prétear!

04:23.480 --> 04:24.700
The Wind Sword!

04:27.250 --> 04:30.450
You can't defeat it if you don't destroy the core! Attack the core!

04:30.450 --> 04:32.080
The core? Where is that?!

04:32.080 --> 04:34.850
Take a good look! You're Prétear, so you must know where it is!

04:35.690 --> 04:37.150
So you say, but...

04:41.590 --> 04:42.650
Could that be it?

04:45.130 --> 04:47.120
Please let that be it!

04:55.940 --> 04:57.600
We won!

05:04.880 --> 05:05.850
What?

05:06.480 --> 05:07.620
Himeno!

05:07.620 --> 05:09.480
All right, Himeno!

05:09.990 --> 05:11.460
A job well done.

05:13.930 --> 05:14.950
I...

05:17.130 --> 05:19.860
Thanks to you, the Leafe returned.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.300
Me?

05:23.300 --> 05:26.640
That's right, Himeno. It's because of you that we could do it.

05:26.640 --> 05:28.000
Because of me.

05:30.040 --> 05:31.780
Hayate! You're hurt?!

05:31.780 --> 05:33.280
Geez...

05:33.280 --> 05:35.970
It's because you totally suck at fighting.

05:36.380 --> 05:37.680
Hayate!

05:37.680 --> 05:41.190
That's not true, Himeno. You did very well.

05:41.190 --> 05:44.190
Nothing ever goes perfectly the first time you try it.

05:44.190 --> 05:47.190
Why?! There's not a scratch on me!

05:47.190 --> 05:48.390
Why is Hayate...

05:48.390 --> 05:50.600
Hayate became your shield.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.400
Shield?!

05:51.400 --> 05:56.770
We Leafe Knights become the Prétear's sword and shield by préting.

05:56.770 --> 05:59.600
In other words, we take the pain and wounds in your place.

06:01.740 --> 06:02.400
Hayate!

06:03.880 --> 06:05.930
This is what the Prétear's battles are.

06:06.580 --> 06:09.050
It's the fate you've accepted.

06:09.880 --> 06:13.940
Think hard on it one more time. You can still turn back.

06:17.790 --> 06:18.650
Himeno?

06:30.270 --> 06:33.400
We take the pain and wounds in your place.

06:34.940 --> 06:38.140
It's the fate you've accepted.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.480
Mom...

06:49.690 --> 06:50.850
I...

07:06.500 --> 07:08.400
That was good!

07:09.770 --> 07:11.980
Mornings are great with milk!

07:11.980 --> 07:14.180
Seeing that expression on your face is a relief.

07:14.180 --> 07:16.940
You didn't seem to be feeling well last night.

07:19.280 --> 07:21.320
Well, that attitude doesn't suit me!

07:21.320 --> 07:22.020
I'm done!

07:22.020 --> 07:24.320
Miss Himeno! It's almost breakfast!

07:24.320 --> 07:25.550
I don't need any this morning!

07:27.490 --> 07:30.600
What's with her? She seems strangely high-spirited.

07:30.600 --> 07:33.260
Hey! Is anyone here?

07:34.630 --> 07:35.720
No one?

07:36.370 --> 07:38.800
Hey, Leafe Knights!

07:41.670 --> 07:42.300
You called?

07:45.240 --> 07:46.640
Should I have not come?

07:46.640 --> 07:47.840
No, it's fine.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.750
Practice?

07:51.750 --> 07:57.120
Yeah, Hayate got hurt because I couldn't fight very well, right?

07:57.120 --> 07:59.320
So, in that case, if I get better at fighting,

07:59.320 --> 08:02.190
...I can prét without any of you Knights getting hurt, right?

08:02.190 --> 08:02.990
That's right.

08:02.990 --> 08:04.480
That's why I want to practice.

08:05.030 --> 08:08.730
I don't want any of you to get hurt next time we fight a demon larva.

08:08.730 --> 08:10.130
Himeno...

08:14.040 --> 08:17.280
Well, seems like she's got some real backbone.

08:17.280 --> 08:19.680
It looks like we didn't need to worry.

08:19.680 --> 08:22.450
Of course not! I knew it with just one look!

08:22.450 --> 08:24.420
"Himeno will be able to do it," I said to myself.

08:24.420 --> 08:26.250
Cocky punk.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.350
Isn't this great, Shin?

08:30.820 --> 08:32.390
Well, then, take my hand.

08:32.390 --> 08:34.190
With you?

08:34.190 --> 08:34.950
Yes...

08:38.200 --> 08:42.570
From my Leafe and your Leafe, a new power will be born.

08:43.570 --> 08:44.870
Now, let's become one.

08:44.870 --> 08:46.000
One...

08:47.370 --> 08:48.470
You don't want to with me?

08:48.470 --> 08:51.980
No, that's not it. It's just that I'm not emotionally prepared.

08:51.980 --> 08:52.780
Prepared?

08:52.780 --> 08:54.770
Oh, don't mind me.

08:56.310 --> 08:57.680
Now then, excuse me...

09:40.590 --> 09:42.990
Wow! So with you, it turns out like this?

09:42.990 --> 09:44.660
This is the sound...

09:44.660 --> 09:45.530
Himeno?

09:45.530 --> 09:48.330
No, sorry, it's nothing.

09:48.330 --> 09:49.430
I see.

09:49.430 --> 09:53.470
Right now, you're the Prétear of Sound. You have command over sound.

09:53.470 --> 09:55.270
Try listening carefully with your ears.

09:55.270 --> 09:57.330
My ears? Like this?

09:58.280 --> 09:59.330
Can you hear?

10:03.110 --> 10:05.640
It sounds like a bunch of noises jumbled together.

10:06.380 --> 10:08.490
Focus your attention on the direction you want to listen.

10:08.490 --> 10:10.120
Focus my attention?

10:10.120 --> 10:12.090
Throw your consciousness in that direction.

10:19.630 --> 10:20.650
Hey, it's Mr. Tanaka.

10:22.830 --> 10:25.640
Wow, Mr. Tanaka likes old Japanese ballads.

10:22.830 --> 10:25.640
I'm a driver!

10:25.640 --> 10:27.130
Try listening farther away.

10:42.020 --> 10:44.390
Amazing! I can see all sorts of things!

10:44.390 --> 10:46.920
You're not seeing them. You're feeling them through sound.

10:46.920 --> 10:49.990
What you're seeing are images created by sound.

10:49.990 --> 10:51.260
Images of sound?

10:51.930 --> 10:53.620
Amazing! This is interesting!

10:54.630 --> 10:55.630
Himeno?

10:55.630 --> 10:58.140
What else? What else can I do?

10:58.140 --> 11:01.440
What? Was she wearing those clothes earlier?

11:01.440 --> 11:03.130
Talk about a boring outfit.

11:04.780 --> 11:05.800
Oh, no!

11:06.240 --> 11:07.850
Well, then, next we'll try an attack.

11:07.850 --> 11:09.580
Try firing a Sonic Arrow.

11:09.580 --> 11:10.980
Sonic Arrow?

11:10.980 --> 11:13.850
You don't need to try to do it well. Just believe in me.

11:14.390 --> 11:15.190
All right.

11:15.190 --> 11:19.180
Stop being tense and relax. Take a few deep breaths.

11:21.730 --> 11:25.090
What is with this?! My beautiful hair's going to be ruined!

11:25.560 --> 11:27.630
Good, that feels right.

11:27.630 --> 11:29.730
Put two fingers on your lips.

11:30.470 --> 11:33.030
Blow your breath between your fingers strongly!

11:36.170 --> 11:36.800
It's free!

11:42.480 --> 11:43.780
Mayune's voice?

11:43.780 --> 11:45.750
It looks like that was a little too strong.

11:50.190 --> 11:51.720
That was very good though.

11:51.720 --> 11:55.290
If you remember how that one went, you'll be able to get a better balance next time.

11:57.630 --> 12:00.400
I wonder what happened to Mayune and Miss Himeno?

12:00.400 --> 12:03.430
They're probably still asleep. It's Sunday after all.

12:03.430 --> 12:04.640
I'm done.

12:04.640 --> 12:09.230
Oh, Mawata, before you go back to your room, call Mayune and Miss Himeno down, would you?

12:10.040 --> 12:11.880
I'm going out immediately.

12:11.880 --> 12:13.470
I see...

12:18.020 --> 12:19.580
No, I shouldn't.

12:19.580 --> 12:20.920
Here you go.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.520
What? I can't!

12:22.520 --> 12:23.990
Thank you!

12:23.990 --> 12:24.990
Good work.

12:24.990 --> 12:27.230
It wasn't really work at all.

12:27.230 --> 12:29.630
You're really good at teaching, Sasame.

12:29.630 --> 12:31.900
That's because you're trying your best.

12:31.900 --> 12:33.870
The principle is how the two people match up.

12:33.870 --> 12:36.200
Once you get used to it, you'll have a better command of things.

12:36.870 --> 12:38.340
You're totally different from Hayate!

12:38.870 --> 12:42.970
With you, I feel as though I can really improve.

12:42.970 --> 12:46.270
Hayate's the opposite! With him, I feel like I keep getting worse!

12:47.080 --> 12:50.150
Hayate just yells at me when something's up!

12:50.150 --> 12:52.820
He's quick to call me an idiot too! Pisses me off!

12:52.820 --> 12:54.990
He's struggling through in his own way.

12:54.990 --> 12:56.590
But I don't like that type!

12:56.590 --> 12:58.380
I don't care how good looking he is!

12:58.990 --> 13:01.690
A man needs to be nice like you, Sasame!

13:02.660 --> 13:04.030
I see, that's good.

13:08.270 --> 13:08.970
Himeno?

13:08.970 --> 13:11.670
I... I'll go buy something to drink!

13:11.670 --> 13:12.230
Hime...

13:13.370 --> 13:15.040
I finally got a new one!

13:15.040 --> 13:16.010
Is that so?

13:16.670 --> 13:18.040
Was that my imagination?

13:18.580 --> 13:19.240
Himeno!

13:21.280 --> 13:22.110
Are you all right?

13:22.480 --> 13:23.740
I'm awl wight.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.340
Welcome...

13:27.180 --> 13:29.620
Why, it's you, Miss Awayuki!

13:29.620 --> 13:32.650
If you had called, we would have had this delivered to you!

13:45.340 --> 13:47.140
Thank you very much!

13:47.140 --> 13:52.730
Hello, Miss Awayuki.

13:47.140 --> 13:50.240
How are you feeling today?

13:53.310 --> 13:55.070
Are you out on a walk, Miss Awayuki?

13:55.780 --> 13:56.870
Miss Awayuki?

14:03.190 --> 14:05.850
Awayuki, Awayuki, Awayuki...

14:07.530 --> 14:10.860
Who's that?! That's not my name.

14:14.770 --> 14:16.600
What's the matter? Are you alone?

14:43.860 --> 14:45.760
Himeno? Are you really all right?

14:45.760 --> 14:48.230
I'm fine. Thanks for everything.

14:48.230 --> 14:51.030
No, I'm the one who needs to say thanks.

14:52.370 --> 14:55.400
Thank you for deciding to be the Prétear.

14:57.170 --> 14:59.400
By saying that, I'm getting a guilty conscience.

15:00.440 --> 15:04.220
A lot of things aren't going well for me at the moment,

15:04.220 --> 15:08.220
...and I thought if there's at least one thing I can do well...

15:08.220 --> 15:12.160
And then I thought, if I run away now, everything will fall apart.

15:12.890 --> 15:14.150
I'm simplistic, aren't I?

15:14.690 --> 15:17.130
If you have some concerns, allow me to listen.

15:17.130 --> 15:19.230
I'm a pro, after all.

15:19.230 --> 15:19.860
A pro?

15:20.600 --> 15:22.160
A radio personality?

15:22.770 --> 15:25.940
Everyone is working in jobs they're specialized at.

15:25.940 --> 15:29.130
Go's at a restaurant, Kei's at a game company, and so on.

15:30.070 --> 15:34.580
We've been investigating any changes in Leafe for quite some time now.

15:34.580 --> 15:36.680
You could say we're like the Leafe Patrol.

15:36.680 --> 15:40.480
Patrol? Like, you receive postcards concerning Leafe or something?

15:40.480 --> 15:43.190
It's a feeling. When there's a shortage of Leafe,

15:43.190 --> 15:46.390
...it's easier to become depressed and gloomy, even topics of conversations.

15:46.390 --> 15:48.980
It's a red alert when such cases increase in number.

15:49.530 --> 15:52.560
When a demon larva shows up, the same thing happens.

15:52.560 --> 15:54.690
They do absorb Leafe after all.

15:56.470 --> 15:57.940
This is the place.

15:57.940 --> 15:59.530
If you'd like, please stay and watch.

16:00.040 --> 16:02.670
This is a taped broadcast that airs at night.

16:02.670 --> 16:04.240
Good morning, Sasame.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.780
Good morning.

16:05.780 --> 16:07.010
Recording Script

16:05.780 --> 16:09.170
Sasame's Words Gate

16:05.780 --> 16:07.010
Much obliged.

16:12.780 --> 16:15.520
Now, let's look at a postcard.

16:15.520 --> 16:19.790
From Miss Silk. She always sends us request postcards.

16:19.790 --> 16:22.160
She's a fourteen year old in junior high school.

16:22.160 --> 16:23.360
I wonder what she's asking today?

16:23.360 --> 16:26.060
Wow, the way he speaks is drawing me in.

16:26.060 --> 16:27.330
Just as expected from the Knight of Sound!

16:27.970 --> 16:33.200
"There's something I think often recently; why am I here?

16:33.970 --> 16:38.680
Everything around me seems to be objects from another dimension...

16:38.680 --> 16:42.740
...and I can't seem to freely accept what's right in front of me.

16:39.680 --> 16:41.250
Sasame's Words Gate

16:39.680 --> 16:41.250
Silk

16:43.380 --> 16:48.340
I can't bear living on every day without knowing why I'm here."

16:51.890 --> 16:56.290
I see. You apparently lost something very important.

16:56.290 --> 17:00.500
I understand that feeling. I, too, felt that way at one time.

17:00.500 --> 17:03.770
But I believe you received something from that important thing...

17:03.770 --> 17:05.970
...and the present you exists because of that.

17:05.970 --> 17:09.970
Miss Silk, if you don't accept yourself,

17:09.970 --> 17:13.380
...what's important to you inside your heart will become meaningless.

17:13.380 --> 17:17.640
If you feel that thing is important to you, then please don't erase its existence.

17:18.780 --> 17:24.190
This man is Kaoru Awayuki, and he will be your new father.

17:24.190 --> 17:27.120
He's a very famous romance novelist!

17:27.120 --> 17:28.890
I'm not writing them anymore though.

17:28.890 --> 17:31.730
I wish you would not say that and start writing again!

17:31.730 --> 17:35.770
I've admired the worlds you created since I was in my teens!

17:35.770 --> 17:38.370
Of course, I admired the novelist who wrote them too.

17:38.370 --> 17:39.600
Really, Natsue...

17:47.240 --> 17:48.730
I'm really impressed!

17:49.280 --> 17:51.650
That was fantastic, Sasame! I may become a fan!

17:51.650 --> 17:53.180
I wonder if I should write a postcard too?

17:53.180 --> 17:55.980
I'd be happy to read your postcard.

18:00.220 --> 18:00.750
Himeno?

18:01.290 --> 18:02.920
What's this feeling?

18:04.760 --> 18:05.890
A demon larva?!

18:15.470 --> 18:17.540
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

18:17.540 --> 18:19.300
Eat, it's good.

18:23.980 --> 18:24.850
Why don't you all...

18:37.390 --> 18:38.090
What?

18:45.970 --> 18:47.140
It's rooted already!

18:47.140 --> 18:48.470
Damn! We're too late!

18:48.470 --> 18:49.270
Mawata!

18:49.270 --> 18:50.770
Shin! The containment field!

18:50.770 --> 18:51.870
<i>Beyondios!</i>

19:05.190 --> 19:06.120
Hayate!

19:06.120 --> 19:08.790
Stop standing around like a dumbass, tulip head!

19:08.790 --> 19:09.290
Tu...

19:09.290 --> 19:10.560
Himeno! Let's prét!

19:44.930 --> 19:46.690
Himeno, can you see the core?

19:51.740 --> 19:52.570
There it is!

19:52.570 --> 19:55.830
All right, relax and do what we did in practice earlier.

19:56.470 --> 19:57.500
Sonic Arrow!

20:00.480 --> 20:01.440
We did it.

20:08.690 --> 20:09.740
Mawata?

20:10.920 --> 20:13.360
Mawata! Mawata!

20:14.530 --> 20:15.890
Mawata!

20:15.890 --> 20:16.930
I...

20:16.930 --> 20:20.730
Well, you seemed to have passed out after getting attacked by a stray dog.

20:20.730 --> 20:21.720
Hey, that kitty!

20:26.670 --> 20:27.670
This postcard...

20:27.670 --> 20:29.970
Give it back! It's my postcard!

20:29.970 --> 20:32.680
I see. So you're Miss Silk.

20:32.680 --> 20:34.610
What? Sasame, from earlier...

20:34.610 --> 20:36.810
Sasame? You?

20:36.810 --> 20:38.750
Thank you for the postcards, always.

20:39.480 --> 20:41.140
I see, that postcard...

20:41.890 --> 20:46.490
Your postcard said, "I can't seem to freely accept what's right in front of me."

20:46.490 --> 20:47.790
I understand that very well.

20:48.390 --> 20:48.690
I...

20:48.690 --> 20:50.590
Don't say that you do!

20:50.590 --> 20:54.330
There's no way you can understand how I feel!

20:55.970 --> 20:57.190
Mawata!

20:59.740 --> 21:02.640
Yo, Himeno! Next time, do it with me!

21:03.370 --> 21:05.580
She going to prét with me next time!

21:05.580 --> 21:07.080
With me! With me!

21:07.080 --> 21:08.340
Shut your trap, shorty!

21:10.280 --> 21:12.680
Look, now he's crying.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.690
Geez, like he thinks it'll be solved by crying.

21:14.690 --> 21:16.620
There, there, don't cry.

21:16.620 --> 21:18.180
You're a boy.

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.330 --> 21:29.030
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
The stars shine in the night sky

21:29.030 --> 21:33.270
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.270 --> 21:39.140
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.140 --> 21:42.010
katte na jinkusu

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:42.010 --> 21:47.990
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.990 --> 21:51.960
ashita wa egao de

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.960 --> 21:58.060
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:58.060 --> 22:02.370
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:02.370 --> 22:03.730
My Sweet Heart

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.730 --> 22:10.040
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:10.040 --> 22:13.810
arienai yurusenai

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.810 --> 22:20.820
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.820 --> 22:29.160
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.770 --> 22:44.680
Hey, Go, could it be I'm a failure as Préte...

22:44.680 --> 22:47.340
Never mind that! Prét with me next time!

22:47.640 --> 22:50.540
The Way of Becoming Prétear

22:48.780 --> 22:50.540
I won't be beaten in the next episode either!
